<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξίσχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέχω</span>
			, once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξίσχει κεφαλὰς δεινοῖο βερέθρου</span>
			<i>puts forth</i> her heads <i>from . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.94
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>stand out, project,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.12.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξίσχοντες ὀφθαλμοί</span>
			<i>prominent</i> eyes, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.30.27
			</span></i>; of bones, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
